# The sobok ghost up close: black hair over a pale face parts to show one
# eye and an open mouth; the white jeogori collar marks her as our design.
# Jump-scare image, full screen 320x180. Show for a few frames only, after
# a quiet build-up, with the jumpscare sound; with "reduce flashing" on,
# show the last frame without flicker. No gore (docs/decisions.md D9).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../jumpscares/jumpscare_sobok_ghost.png
@preview ../previews/jumpscare_sobok_ghost_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame hair





















































































































































































@frame parting





















































































































































































@frame face




















































































































































































